<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru-RU" prefix="og: https://ogp.me/ns#"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,shrink-to-fit=no, viewport-fit=cover">
  <link rel="icon" href="https://block.wink.ru/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
  <link rel="icon" href="https://block.wink.ru/icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <title>Геоблокировка</title>
  <style>
    @font-face {
      font-family: 'CoFo Sans';
      src: url('/fonts/var/CoFoSans-base.woff2') format('woff2 supports variations'),
      url('./fonts/var/CoFoSans-base.woff2') format('woff2-variations');
      font-weight: 100 900;
      font-style: normal;
      font-display: swap;
      unicode-range: U+0020-007E, U+00A9, U+00AB, U+00BB, U+0401, U+0410-044F, U+0451, U+2012-2014, U+2018-201A, U+201C-201E, U+2026, U+20BD;
    }

    @font-face {
      font-family: 'CoFo Kak';
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-display: swap;
      src: url('/fonts/CoFoKak-Black-base.woff2') format('woff2');
      unicode-range: U+0020-007E, U+00AB, U+00BB, U+0401, U+0410-044F, U+0451, U+2012-2014, U+2018-201A, U+201C-201E, U+2026, U+20BD;
    }

    :root {
      --color-bern: #000;
      --color-sochi: #fff;
      --text-color: var(--color-sochi);
      --color-sochi-40: rgba(255 255 255 / 40%);
    }

    * {
      scrollbar-color: var(--color-sochi-40) var(--color-bern);
      scrollbar-width: thin;
    }

    html, body {
      background: var(--color-bern);
      box-sizing: border-box;
      color: var(--text-color);
      display: block;
      width: 100vw;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'CoFo Sans', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
      color:var(--text-color);
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      overflow-y: scroll;
      scrollbar-gutter: stable;
    }

    .bg {
      position: absolute;
      height: 100%;
      width: 768px;
      bottom: 0;
      right: 0;
      background: url('/images/geo.svg') left 50% no-repeat;
      background-size: 1080px 380px;
    }

    .root {
      padding: 20px 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 404px;
    }

    img.logo {
      display: block;
      height: 27px;
      width: 87px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-family: 'CoFo Kak', sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 26px;
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0;
      line-height: 16px;
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 623px) {
      .bg {
        height: 70%;
        width: 100%;
        background-position: 47% 50%;
      }
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 624px) and (max-width: 1023px) {
      .bg {
        height: 70%;
      }
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 624px) {
      .root {
        padding: 80px max(147px, 18%);
      }

      img.logo {
        margin-bottom: 75px;
        height: 32px;
        width: 122px;
      }
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 1024px) {
      .root {
        padding: 120px 100px;
      }
    }

    @media screen and (min-width: 1280px) {
      .bg {
        width: calc(105% - 476px - 195px);
        background-size: 140%;
      }

      .root {
        padding: 120px 195px;
      }

      .content {
        max-width: 476px;
      }

      p {
        line-height: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg"></div>
<div class="root">
  <div class="content">
    <img class="logo" src="/images/wink.svg" alt="Logo">
    <h1>Wink не работает в вашей стране или при включённом VPN</h1>
    <p>
      Отключите VPN или Proxy и обновите страницу.
      <br><br>
      Сервис может быть недоступен в некоторых регионах.

    </p>
  </div>
</div>
</body></html>